---
description: Minimal always-on engineering constraints
alwaysApply: true
---

# Core

- Prefer latest stable/LTS runtimes and maintained stable libraries.
- Reuse existing code; avoid duplication; extract shared logic.
- Organize code by feature.
- Keep one purpose per folder.
- Expose public APIs; avoid cross-feature deep imports.
- Add/update unit tests; run coverage and report results.
- Keep testable requirements in `REQUIREMENTS.md`.
- Keep usage instructions in `README.md`.
- Record release-worthy changes under `CHANGELOG.md`’s `[Unreleased]`.
- Markdown: one H1; unskipped headings; `-` lists; tagged fences; inline-code paths/commands; relative internal links.
